# --- Secrets Registry policy (self-contained, added 2026-08-24) ---
# This repo protects its OWN secrets. Do NOT rely on ~/.config/git/ignore:
# a machine-global excludesFile does not travel with a clone, a restored
# bundle, a CI checkout, or a fresh machine. Keep this block in-repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
!.env.sample
.secrets.map
.npmrc
.netrc
